{"3281410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ells Tales: Chairbound", "steam_appid": 3281410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>ATTENTION!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281410/extras/d9563d77023f1c0dde521e0691615241.avif?t=1785895449\" width=780 height=154 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>You wake up tied to an office chair in the middle of an empty room. A mysterious device with a 10-minute timer is attached to you. Explore the office floors, try not to tip over, and find a way to escape!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281410/extras/3c7c6c49f597ff2be1f6dabaf9e1aeac.poster.avif?t=1785895449\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281410/extras/3c7c6c49f597ff2be1f6dabaf9e1aeac.webm?t=1785895449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Physics simulation of an office chair on wheels. Move around the floors, but be careful not to tip over.<br></li><li> The aesthetics of liminal spaces. Explore the floors of the gloomy office building.<br></li><li> Separate control of each of the character's hands.<br></li><li> Retro style, a distinctive feature of the Ells Tales series.<br></li><li> Bonus: ray tracing for owners of modern graphics cards, adding even more depth and atmosphere to the visuals.</li></ul><br><i>If you need a little hint, check out the news about the game's release.</i>", "about_the_game": "You wake up tied to an office chair in the middle of an empty room. A mysterious device with a 10-minute timer is attached to you. Explore the office floors, try not to tip over, and find a way t